{"t":23.68,"code":0,"d":{"duration_api_ms":9066,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"12fd4dc3-3c76-4464-ae22-a10372078ff3","total_cost_usd":0.0249394,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3637,"cache_read_input_tokens":11694,"output_tokens":921,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3637,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":576,"cache_read_input_tokens":5404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":921,"cacheReadInputTokens":11694,"cacheCreationInputTokens":3637,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0249394,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":3637,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":3,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Mostly no. The equity window is poor right now, and Pellham, the largest buyer, has already shown it can't count on it.** The evidence is thin and covers only two companies.\n\n- **Pellham Power:** It withdrew a planned C$2.4B equity offering because investor demand fell short. It is now cutting 2027 transformer orders by about 40% and deferring two substation programmes \"until financing improves.\" This is the clearest failure, and it is already changing real spending. Pellham plans 2027 capex up 18%, so its funding gap is large.\n- **Wider market:** Two utility share offerings were cut back in size in Q3 2026. That points to a broad lack of appetite for utility equity, not just a Pellham problem.\n- **Norvane Utilities:** It has 2027 capex up 12% and priced a C$1.1B bond comfortably. That suggests it can turn to debt rather than equity. Bond spreads widened 30bp to 165bp in Q3, so debt is getting more expensive.\n- **Valuations and dilution:** I found no valuation multiples or share-price data. I can't quantify dilution. Weak demand and downsized or withdrawn deals imply that any equity raised now would be priced at a discount and dilute existing holders more.\n- **Window:** It looks shut or only partly open for now. Pellham's deferrals depend on financing improving, so a reopening would be the signal to watch.\n\n**Implication:** Equity can't be relied on to fund the full 2027 plans. Expect capex to be funded more by debt, which is costlier, and to slip, especially at Pellham. That is negative for grid-equipment orders, mainly transformers and substations.\n\nSource documents: pellham-offering, utility-capex-2027, utility-credit.","ttft_ms":2410,"type":"result","duration_ms":18749,"uuid":"248dff5e-2e6f-4205-9db8-a3872fcd9985","ttft_stream_ms":952,"time_to_request_ms":56,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":4,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":7,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":2,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":1,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":5,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":2,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":5},"turn_start_resume_kin